## Why LiveKit

Google lists LiveKit as a supported integration path for Gemini Live, and LiveKit provides an agent layer for real-time media. ([Google AI for Developers][2])

Use it for:

* browser camera session;
* audio/video transport;
* trainer joining the room;
* recording only with consent;
* AI audio coaching;
* hand-off from AI to human;
* session metadata.

Daily is a credible alternative with a mature front-end video library. ([Daily][6])

## Why Cal.com

Cal.com API v2 supports programmatic booking creation, allowing the product to display trainer availability and create bookings without building scheduling infrastructure from scratch. ([Cal][7])

Initial flow:

```text
AI determines trainer type
→ filter approved trainers
→ request available slots from Cal.com
→ user chooses inside PWA
→ create booking
→ attach structured intake summary
→ record referral attribution
→ send WhatsApp confirmation
```

Use separate Cal.com event types for:

* 15-minute suitability call;
* 30-minute video review;
* 45-minute remote session;
* in-person first assessment;
* urgent behaviour consult.

